@startuml
title Состояния синхронизации
hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #FFF6DA
  BorderColor #8A6D1D
}
state DISABLED
state "enabled = true" as Enabled {
  state IDLE
  state BLOCKED
  state CANCELLING
  state "Ожидание и выполнение" as Active {
    state QUEUED
    state DISCOVERING_PROTOCOL
    state DISCOVERING_FOLDERS
    state DOWNLOADING
    state APPLYING
    QUEUED --> DISCOVERING_PROTOCOL : нет live capabilities
    QUEUED --> DISCOVERING_FOLDERS : capabilities есть
    DISCOVERING_PROTOCOL --> DISCOVERING_FOLDERS : OPTIONS
    DISCOVERING_FOLDERS --> DOWNLOADING : папка готова
    DOWNLOADING --> APPLYING : page получена
    APPLYING --> DISCOVERING_FOLDERS : MoreAvailable, slice продолжается
    APPLYING --> QUEUED : continuation / follow-up
  }
  IDLE --> QUEUED : Sync Now / periodic
  BLOCKED --> QUEUED : ручной retry / periodic\nпосле TRANSIENT_EXHAUSTED
  APPLYING --> IDLE : terminal page, нет follow-up
  Active --> CANCELLING : Cancel, run token++
  CANCELLING --> IDLE : execution отменена
  Active --> BLOCKED : постоянная проблема\nили исчерпан retry budget
}
[*] --> DISABLED
DISABLED --> QUEUED : activation / Enable\nновая generation + run token
Enabled --> DISABLED : Disable\ninvalidate, cancel, cleanup

legend bottom
Transient failure -> QUEUED + retry.
Recoverable capacity/reset -> QUEUED + continuation.
Cold process: активная phase -> QUEUED.
Повторный trigger сохраняет один follow-up.
Cleanup failure оставляет DISABLED + pending cleanup.
Retry очистки не включает сеть или schedules.
Побочные эффекты разрешены только
при совпадении generation/run token.
endlegend
@enduml
